    "debug-merc-size-runtime",
    // in-game-menu-hud2 rung: in-game-menu-startup keeps its pre-existing
    // og:preserve-this bring-up stub (forge #115) instead of its own clean
    // decode; the stub is a deliberate no-op documented as a fix for a
