    // explicit casts at those sites instead.
    "(method 19 in-game-menu-hud)",
    "(method 19 in-game-menu-hud-options)",
    "(method 9 in-game-menu-hud-options)",
    // hud-widgets-2 rung: (method 24 hud-indicate-death) and (method 23
    // hud-indicate-death) both dispatch hud-item-string-method-24 through a
    // hud-item-group items array access (a constant index in method 24's own
