    // own two methods above.
    "(method 24 hud-indicate-death)",
    "(method 23 hud-indicate-death)",
    // hud-widgets-3 rung: (method 19 hud-points-combo) dispatches hud-
    // item-string-method-26 through a constant-index items access; the
    // raw decode's own type_casts-driven analysis resolves the dispatch
