    // generic hud-item, so a fresh compile of the raw decode rejects it
    // as "No method or function named hud-item-string-method-26 for type
    // hud-item". The landed goal_src carries the explicit (the-as hud-
    // item-string ...) cast instead, the same class already skipped for
