    // bring-up stub precedent as hud-string-init above.
    "hud-string-draw-all",
    // hud-4 rung: (method 9 hud-string) is still skipped, but not for the
    // raw-dma-packet class the earlier hud rung named; that class is fixed
    // now (see hud-corners/hud-sprite/hud-box below). Its own fresh decode
    // fails on a single "add failed: object <integer 28>" at op 0 because
