    // rung. Held un-landed (commented out) in goal_src; see the
    // og:preserve-this comment there. hud-headset-talker inherits hud-item-
    // group's own landed method 19 (net-hud.gc) in the meantime, the normal
    // virtual-dispatch behavior for an unfilled vtable slot, not a jump to
    // zero.
    "(method 19 hud-headset-talker)",
    // hud-widgets-tier rung: (method 19 end-menu)'s own fresh decode does
    // not convert to expressions at all ("function was not converted to
